🔗 Frontend ↔ Backend Communication (Simple)

🖥️ Frontend
1. What the user sees
2. HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React
3. Sends HTTP requests


--> Backend
1. Runs on server
2. Java, Python, PHP, Node
3. Processes request & sends response



🔄 How They Communicate
Frontend (Browser)
     |
     |  HTTP Request (GET / POST)
     ↓
Backend (Server)
     |
     |  HTTP Response (JSON / HTML)
     ↓
Frontend (Browser)